                        <field name="dc_description">Printed for J. Wright, opposite Old Bond-street, Piccadilly, London. -- At foot of title "Second edition". -- Includes appendix. -- Includes plate of the total value of imports and exports in Great Britain for the year ending 5th January, 1799. -- Includes plate of the average annual amount in the three years preceding the 25th March 1798, of the duties of customs collected in Ireland in commercial interactions with Great Britain, distinguishing the wollen and cotton manufactureres and the Irish and foreign linens imported and exported. -- Includes plate of the average annual amount in the three years preceding the 25th of March, 1798, of the duties colllected in Ireland, on the exports from and imports into the country, to and from the States of America, and all other parts, other than Great Britain and her dependences, distinguishing the principal articles in the year ending March, 1798. -- Includes publishers advertisement. </field>
